---
const { lang } = Astro.props;
---
<!-- Security Section -->
<section class="security-section">
  <div class="section-header animate-on-scroll">
      <h2 class="text-gradient">🛡️ Segurança Máxima no GetNexo</h2>
      <p>Proteja sua loja e clientes com segurança enterprise-grade</p>
  </div>

  <div class="security-grid animate-on-scroll">
    <div class="security-card glass-panel">
      <div class="security-icon">🛡️</div>
      <h3>Cloudflare Shield</h3>
      <p>Proteção contra DDoS, Firewall Avançado (WAF) e Gerenciamento de Bots. Sua loja protegida como as maiores do mundo.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="security-card glass-panel">
      <div class="security-icon">🔐</div>
      <h3>AES Encryption</h3>
      <p>Criptografia LGPD-compliant com AES-256. Conformidade 100% LGPD. Zero armazenamento desnecessário.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="security-card glass-panel">
      <div class="security-icon">🚪</div>
      <h3>Zero Trust Network</h3>
      <p>Cloudflare Tunnel com Zero Trust. Nenhuma porta aberta no servidor. Conexão outbound apenas.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="security-card glass-panel">
      <div class="security-icon">⏰</div>
      <h3>24h Monitoring</h3>
      <p>Rate Limiting inteligente, detecção de ameaças em tempo real e backups seguros automatizados.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="security-card glass-panel">
      <div class="security-icon">💳</div>
      <h3>Secure PIX</h3>
      <p>Integração direta com gateways confiáveis. QR Code validado e criptografado em tempo real.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="security-card glass-panel">
      <div class="security-icon">✅</div>
      <h3>99.99% Uptime</h3>
      <p>Sua loja nunca fica offline. Sem histórico de breaches. Atualizações automáticas.</p>
    </div>
  </div>


</section>

<style>
  .security-section {
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out 0.1s forwards;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: white;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
  }

  .section-header p {
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .security-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .security-card {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01) 100%) !important;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border-radius: 40px !important; /* Forced rounded corners */
    padding: 2.5rem;
    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .security-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.05), transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .security-card:nth-child(1) { animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out 0.2s forwards; }
  .security-card:nth-child(2) { animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out 0.3s forwards; }
  .security-card:nth-child(3) { animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out 0.4s forwards; }
  .security-card:nth-child(4) { animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out 0.5s forwards; }
  .security-card:nth-child(5) { animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out 0.6s forwards; }
  .security-card:nth-child(6) { animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out 0.7s forwards; }

  @keyframes fadeInUp {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  .security-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    border-color: rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.3);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .security-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .security-card h3 {
    color: white;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .security-card p {
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .security-section {
      padding: 4rem 1rem;
    }

    .section-header {
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .section-header h2 {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }

    .section-header p {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .security-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .security-card {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
